# Root-image mount points that Oniro's build/ohos/images/build_image.py adds
# (build 6f57e95c, for x86_64) and the OHOS policy has no label for;
# e2fsdroid refuses to pack an unlabeled path.  Labeled like /tmp, /storage.
/run          u:object_r:rootfs:s0
/var          u:object_r:rootfs:s0
/opt          u:object_r:rootfs:s0
/usr          u:object_r:rootfs:s0
